.git
**/target
**/__pycache__
# demo/generated holds the relying party's private key and certificate, the
# IdP metadata, and any other file the install script wrote. Only idpCa's file,
# the iya-sts listener CA trust chain, goes into the demo image (Dockerfile,
# COPY demo ./demo).
demo/generated/*
!demo/generated/idp-ca.pem
